// Real lead data imported from the team's "CLIENT LEAD LIST - Tracker"
// spreadsheet (77 tabs, 74 real lead lists after excluding the Leads
// Tracker / Booking Tracker dashboards and the empty "For Sorting"
// tab). Used by importContactData() in db.js to (re)populate the
// contacts and contact_columns tables — see the Contacts page's
// Import button.
//
// Extraction notes:
// - Each record's `tag` and `client` are the exact sheet tab name it
//   came from (e.g. "9. Khan Legal"), trimmed.
// - Date/Name/Phone/Email columns (however they were labeled per
//   tab — DATE, First Name + Last Name, Mobile Phone, HONE, etc.)
//   were mapped onto the fixed name/phone/email/leadDate fields;
//   every other column on a tab became a custom column, keyed by the
//   same slugify() rule server/db.js uses for real columns, so a
//   shared question like "Notes" collapses onto one column instead
//   of duplicating per tab.
// - 21 Meta/Facebook Lead Ads automated test submissions ("<test
//   lead: dummy data for ...>", test@meta.com) were excluded — never
//   real leads.
// - `status` is left at the app's default ("New Lead") for every
//   record — the sheet's own STAGE/STATUS values (which vary wildly
//   per tab and don't map cleanly onto that fixed pipeline field)
//   are preserved instead as their own custom column(s).
